  m_text: 'What is a tuning system?<line-height=50%>


    <size=35.8><color=#414138>Think<line-height=100%>
    of how a piano is divided into sets of 12 tones






    <voffset=2.3em>

    Here,
    the pitch of each tone is <color=#D6A71F>spaced equally<color=#1B1B19> apart.'
